left.raw_text:
Inclusion Criteria:
  -  Handball players;
  -  Healthy;
  -  Participation of at least one official match  [AND] in the last year and attend 70% of the team's activities during the current season

right.raw_text:
Exclusion Criteria:
  -  musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;
  -  cardiovascular diseases;
  -  use of anabolic, [OR]  anti-inflammatory  [OR] and analgesic drugs 72 hours before the evaluations;
  -  use of alcohol  [OR] and illicit drugs during the collection period;
